  "description": "ABUQEY crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C168 H144 N70 O48 Tb8 2+,8(H2 O1),2(N1 O2 1-). From the CIF bond table, Tb01 (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Tb02 (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Tb03 (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Tb04 (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Tb5 (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Tb6 (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Tb7 (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Tb8 (Tb) has 8 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 12 pairs, 2 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.821-3.899 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 103.96-109.32°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Tb4(OH)4(H2O)6(bppCOO)7]NO3·2H2O. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 4 OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 6 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article formula).",
